  "description": "<p>⭐ <em>Dance the night away at a Silent Disco inside the spectacular Temperate House at the Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n✨ Are you a Kew Member? Get discounted tickets by following&nbsp;<a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/584806?c=kew-gardens-members\" target=\"_blank\"><u>this link</u></a>. In order to qualify for member rates, you will be required to enter your membership number at checkout.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🎧 Wireless headphones with two music channels, letting you switch between DJs and choose your vibe<br>\r\n🌿 A unique dancefloor set inside the breathtaking Temperate House, surrounded by rare and exotic plants<br>\r\n🌍 An immersive party experience in one of London’s most extraordinary botanical settings<br>\r\n🔊 Crystal-clear sound through your headset while preserving the tranquillity of the Gardens<br>\r\n🍸 A full bar serving drinks and tasty bites available throughout the evening</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date and time: Choose in the ticket selector<br>\r\n📍 Location: Temperate House, entry via Temperate House Gate, Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew<br>\r\n🎟️ Daytime Gardens entry is not included in the price of your ticket. To visit Kew during the day, please book tickets at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.kew.org/kew-gardens/visit-kew-gardens/tickets\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kew.org/kew-<wbr>gardens/visit-kew-gardens/<wbr>tickets</a><br>\r\n🔞 Age requirement: 18+ with valid ID<br>\r\n❓Any questions? Please refer to the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTHWVIzqVjoTnAEQl-_4EhONggn5wnl50C28P7V5fc66ZER9GqWzWc_wg5oYg3c58SOlaTwZAkhpMWF/pub\" target=\"_blank\">FAQs</a> for more details.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nStep into the iconic Temperate House at Kew Gardens for a Silent Disco like no other. Slip on your wireless headphones, pick your channel and dance beneath the soaring glass ceilings of this stunning botanical cathedral. With two DJs playing simultaneously, you’re free to switch between sounds and find the rhythm that moves you most. This unique party experience blends music, atmosphere and nature in perfect harmony. While the Gardens remain peaceful around you, your headset delivers an immersive soundtrack for an unforgettable night of dancing. With a fully stocked bar on hand to keep the energy flowing, all that’s left to do is grab your friends, lace up your dancing shoes and lose yourself in the music.&nbsp;Get your tickets now!</p>",
